1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:03,870
Sewer ke manhole ka dhakkan jyadatar gol kyun hota hai?

2
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:07,880
Kyunki square dhakkan apne hi gaddhe mein gir sakta hai! Par kaise?

3
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:11,900
Square ka kone se kone wala hissa, side se lamba hota hai.

4
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,620
Square dhakkan ko tircha karo, toh woh isi lambe hisse se seedha andar gir jaata hai.

5
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:19,310
Par gol? Har taraf se ek jaisa chauda.

6
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:22,300
Kaise bhi ghumao, apne gaddhe mein kabhi nahi girega.

7
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:26,320
Aur bhaari gol dhakkan ko uthana nahi padta, pahiye ki tarah lurhka do.

8
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:30,560
Aur rakhte waqt line up bhi nahi karna padta. Kisi bhi taraf se rakho, fit!

9
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:33,850
Aise roz ke "kyun" ke liye Whysplained ko subscribe karo.

10
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:38,240
Hum sawaal gol rakhte hain, jawab ekdum seedhe!
